NamoNexus — Alembic Migrations
==============================

Run from: backend/namo_core/

  alembic upgrade head          Apply all pending migrations
  alembic downgrade -1          Roll back the last migration
  alembic current               Show current revision
  alembic history               Show full migration history
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"
                                Generate a new migration from model changes
  alembic upgrade head --sql    Print SQL without applying (dry-run review)

Database URL is read automatically from NAMO_DATABASE_URL in .env or
GCP Secret Manager — never hard-coded here.
